  "description": "Platform view of kube-oidc-proxy: what holds connections and memory, how the API server dependency behaves, whether the review caches are earning their keep, and the Go runtime underneath. Use it to size replicas and to decide whether latency seen on the Overview is the proxy or its upstream.",
