    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Review latency p99 by review",
      "description": "How long the TokenReview and SubjectAccessReview calls the proxy issues take at the 99th percentile. Every one of these is on the request path, so this latency is added to the requests that trigger it: a slow API server here becomes a slow proxy on the Overview.",
