    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cache hit ratio by cache",
      "description": "Share of review cache lookups served without an API server call, per cache. A low ratio means the caches are not earning their keep and every request pays for a review; check the TTLs before adding replicas. A 'bypass' result is a lookup the cache was not allowed to answer, and counts against the ratio.",
      "datasource": {
